comment: player class demo
this that "Player"
    let "health" become 100.

    this function "heal" with "amount"
        change "health" to the value of "health" plus the value of "amount".
    end this

    this function "status"
        say "Health:".
        say the value of "health".
    end this
end this that

let "hero" become a new "Player".
that "hero" function "heal" with 20.
that "hero" function "status".
end executable.